OL,4,BStrasbourg announce appointment of     
OL,5,BSwans boss Matos                       
OL,6,GStrasbourg have announced the          
OL,7,Gappointment of Swansea City's Vitor    
OL,8,GMatos as the club's new head coach.    
OL,10,FThe French top-flight side made the    
OL,11,Fannouncement on Wednesday evening, but 
OL,12,Fthere has been no confirmation of      
OL,13,FMatos' departure from the Swans.       
OL,15,FStrasbourg are expected to pay Swansea 
OL,16,Fcompensation thought to be in the      
OL,17,Fregion of #5m in order to secure his   
OL,18,Fservices.                              
